---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'FAM Trip Resources | Travel Agent Toolkit Malaysia',
  description: 'Download our FAM trip guides, destination overviews, sample itineraries, and marketing materials for travel agents selling Malaysian food experiences.',
  image: 'https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/hand-dipping-lumpia-in-penang-laksa.jpg',
  canonical: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com/fam-trip-resources',
  robots: {
    index: true,
    follow: true,
  },
};
---

<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'FAM Trip Resources',
  description: 'Resources for travel agents including destination guides, sample itineraries, pricing sheets, and marketing materials.',
  url: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com/fam-trip-resources',
  isPartOf: {
    '@type': 'WebSite',
    name: 'Culinary Travel Experts',
    url: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com'
  }
})} />

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">FAM Trip Resources</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted mb-8">
        Everything you need to confidently sell Malaysian food experiences to your clients.
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <p>
          We have created these resources to help you sell with confidence. Each guide includes the information your clients will ask about, and the talking points that help you differentiate our experiences from standard food tours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Read before you sell</h2>
              <p class="text-muted mb-4">Practical, honest guidance from 15 years of running food experiences. Written for agents, usable with clients.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 mt-4">
            <a href="/blog/would-you-sell-disappointment" class="block p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Would You Sell Disappointment?</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">A guest wanted fireflies, blue tears, and a vegan dinner. The eco-boat uses diesel. The fireflies are often underwhelming. Here is how we think about experiences that might not deliver, and what you should know before you promise.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/greenwashing-malaysian-tourism" class="block p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Greenwashing in Malaysian Tourism</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Companies advertise "whispering boats" and eco-friendly experiences while running diesel engines. Here is how to spot genuine sustainability versus marketing spin, for yourself and for your clients.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/how-to-sell-malaysian-food-tours" class="block p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <h3 class="font-semibold">How to Sell Malaysian Food Tours to Skeptical Clients</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Common objections: "Will they like the food?" "Is it safe?" "Is it too spicy?" Here is how to position the experience, manage expectations, and convert hesitant clients.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Trade Kit</h2>
              <p class="text-muted mb-4">Pricing, commission structure, destination overviews, sample itineraries, and marketing copy. Request it and we send the full package with your partner terms.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="#contact" class="text-accent hover:underline">Request →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Want the full trade kit?</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
          Register as a partner and we will send the complete package: destination guides, sample itineraries, pricing, commission terms, and marketing materials.
        </p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Request Trade Kit</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- TBD (verify before deploy): booking confirmation within 48h / same-day urgent
             handling, pre-planned weather/market-closure alternatives, small-agency
             support, and FAM/hosted visits for agents are OPERATIONAL CLAIMS written
             from the strategy docs, not yet confirmed by the operator. Commission
             numbers (20-25% tours / 15% private) come from cte-b2b-content-strategy.md. -->
        <h2>What is in the Trade Kit?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Destination Guides:</strong> 6 cities, each with vendor profiles, dish highlights, cultural notes</li>
          <li><strong>Sample Itineraries:</strong> Ready-to-sell routes across all regions</li>
          <li><strong>Pricing Sheet:</strong> Agent rates, commission structure, group size recommendations</li>
          <li><strong>Marketing Assets:</strong> Photos, social media templates, email templates</li>
          <li><strong>Agent Toolkit:</strong> FAQ document, objection handling guide, sustainability talking points</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Common questions from agents</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>How fast can we confirm a booking?</strong> Most requests are confirmed within 48 hours. Urgent requests are handled same-day where vendor availability allows.</li>
          <li><strong>What if my client has dietary restrictions?</strong> Halal, vegetarian, vegan, and allergy needs are confirmed with every vendor before the tour. We do not improvise dietary needs on the day.</li>
          <li><strong>What happens if the tour cannot run?</strong> Weather, market closures, and vendor emergencies have pre-planned alternatives. You are informed before your client is affected.</li>
          <li><strong>Do you work with small agencies?</strong> Yes. We have partners who book a few tours a year and partners who book every week. The agreement is the same, the support scales with volume.</li>
          <li><strong>Can we see the experiences before we sell them?</strong> Yes. Join one of our familiarization visits or send a colleague on a hosted tour before you commit to selling.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section id="contact" class="py-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Request the Trade Kit</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-4xl">
          <form>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <input type="text" placeholder="Name" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <input type="email" placeholder="Email" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <input type="text" placeholder="Agency or company" class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <textarea placeholder="What are you planning to sell?" rows="4" class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default"></textarea>
              <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-secondary transition-colors cursor-pointer">Request Trade Kit</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Email</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1"><a href="mailto:hello@culinarytravelexperts.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@culinarytravelexperts.com</a></p></div>
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Based In</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1">Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted mt-4 text-sm">We respond within 24 hours.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

